# Bank 9 (runs at 0x8000). Directives: L label, C line comment, B block
# header, D data range, F row width.
#
# THIS BANK HOLDS NO CODE. These are the fixed screens: the title, the ship
# map and the text screens. It is mapped together with bank 10 (0xA000) from
# p00:5315-p00:5321, p00:5B34-p00:5B3E, p00:5B7D-p00:5B87 and
# p00:5BFE-p00:5C08.
#
# Almost all of it is compressed blocks for 0x49B9 (tools/rle.py). The proof
# that they are correctly delimited is that the chains fit with no slack:
# from 0x8300 to 0x9B3F there are exactly six blocks, and from 0x9C57 to the
# end of the bank, two.

B 0x8000 FIXED SCREENS (bank 9)

D 0x8000 0x8300 name_table_screen  768 raw bytes (not compressed) that 0x5C66 copies with LDIRVM to VRAM 0x3800: a whole name table, 24 rows of 32 characters.
F 0x8000 32
D 0x8300 0x87FA graphics_colours_2008  Compressed block that 0x5C15 dumps into VRAM 0x2008 (colours, first third).
F 0x8300 16
D 0x87FA 0x8CB2 graphics_colours_2808  Compressed block that 0x5C1E dumps into VRAM 0x2808 (colours, second third).
F 0x87FA 16
D 0x8CB2 0x917E graphics_colours_3008  Compressed block that 0x5C27 dumps into VRAM 0x3008 (colours, third third).
F 0x8CB2 16
D 0x917E 0x9515 graphics_patterns_0008  Compressed block that 0x5C30 dumps into VRAM 0x0008 (patterns, first third).
F 0x917E 16
D 0x9515 0x989F graphics_patterns_0808  Compressed block that 0x5C39 dumps into VRAM 0x0808 (patterns, second third).
F 0x9515 16
D 0x989F 0x9B3F graphics_patterns_1008  Compressed block that 0x5C42 dumps into VRAM 0x1008 (patterns, third third).
F 0x989F 16
D 0x9B3F 0x9BCB graphics_9B3F  Compressed block requested by 0x5B98.
F 0x9B3F 16
D 0x9BCB 0x9C57 graphics_9BCB  Compressed block requested by 0x5B93.
F 0x9BCB 16
D 0x9C57 0x9EAB graphics_2468  Compressed block that 0x5B56 passes to 0x4988 with HL=0x2468: 0x4988 dumps it three times, once per screen third, adding 0x800 each time.
F 0x9C57 16
D 0x9EAB 0xA000 graphics_0468  Compressed block that 0x5B5F passes to 0x4988 with HL=0x0468, again across the three thirds.
F 0x9EAB 16
